      "media/image7.png"
    ]
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Visionary Path Services is an education loan assistance and guidance company focused on helping students  with Domestic, International, and MBBS Education Loans.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "We provide genuine, transparent, and profile-based guidance throughout the education-loan journey—from eligibility assessment and documentation to application processing, sanction, and disbursement support.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "We believe in clear guidance, honest communication, and step-by-step support—not false promises.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "At Visionary Path Services, we believe that financial limitations should not stand in the way of a student's education and career aspirations.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "We are an Education Loan Assistance and Guidance company helping students and parents navigate the education-loan process for higher education in India and abroad.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Our core focus is on:",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Domestic Education LoansInternational Education LoansMBBS Education Loans — India & Abroad",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "From understanding your financial and academic profile to guiding you through documentation, application processing and the next steps toward sanction and disbursement, we aim to make the education-loan journey simpler, clearer and more organized.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Our Mission",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Making Education Funding Simpler for Every Student",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "Our mission is to provide students and parents with clear, practical and personalized education-loan guidance so they can make informed decisions about financing their education.",
    "images": []
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "We focus on understanding each student's profile rather than suggesting the same solution to everyone.",
    "images": []
